/-!
# Source-native M14 culture coordinates

The culture occurrence is the exact two-point restriction generated by the
existing cycle-memory refinement.  Its Boolean index is downstream only:
`true` denotes the witnessed `base + 3` occurrence and `false` the exact
unwitnessed `base` occurrence through `exactOccurrence`.

Every coordinate below is a low-universe readout of those source occurrences.
In particular, replay support is generated by the actual communication path's
event supports and the honest publication bit.  The action-occurrence
authority remains recoverable from its source depth; it is not stored inside
the low-universe lineage code.

No consumer family, culture carrier, quotient, factorization, root, ledger,
institutional revision, or successor is defined here.
-/

set_option autoImplicit false

namespace SaturationMonoid
namespace NoIslandNoMagic
namespace Consciousness
namespace Culture
namespace M14
namespace Interface

open ProcessGame Society
open ResponsibilityLifecycle LivingLawEvolution
open ConstructiveRoot
